<title>UK: Advan sets $100 million 4-year bond with warrants.</title>
<headline>Advan sets $100 million 4-year bond with warrants.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following equity-linked issue was announced by lead manager Nomura International.</p>
<p> BORROWER   ADVAN CO LTD</p>
<p>GUARANTOR  LONG TERM CREDIT BANK OF JAPAN</p>
<p> AMT    $100 MLN	COUPON     3.50	MATURITY    03.OCT.00</p>
<p> TYPE     WARRANTS    ISS PRICE  100.0     PAY DATE    03.OCT.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  2.25	IND PREM   =</p>
<p> LISTING    LUX	 DENOMS (K) 10*	 SALE LIMITS =</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  =	   TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.75	SELL CONC  1.50     PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p> NOTES	*PLUS 2 WARRANTS</p>
<p>		EXERCISE PERIOD   - 17.OCT.96-20.SEP.00</p>
<p>-- LONDON NEWSROOM +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
